WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.040
You are my sun now

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.460
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.460
no matter who you are

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.890
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:45.600
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
is clear again

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.360
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.870
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.210
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.880
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:16.720
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:23.520
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:30.900
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:38.240
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:57.070 --> 00:02:04.770
<i>With Manus as his guide, Lief went to save his captured friends Jasmine, Barda and Doom.</i>

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:11.560
<i>With success in sight for the rescue
mission, Lief was suddenly cornered.</i>

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:14.730
<i>The one who came to his rescue was Prin.</i>

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:20.200
<i>But, the underhanded Fallow captured
Lief's parents, Jarred and Anna,</i>

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:23.030
<i>and demanded that he surrender the Belt.</i>

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:39.680
Now, hand me the Belt, Lief!

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:47.890
Or, would you prefer to see your parents die?

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.700
Fallow, this is unfair!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.000
All is fair in war.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.200
Now, what will you do, Lief?

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.290
Father...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.300
Mother...

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:20.800
Lief...

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.090
Hurry up and decide!

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.100
I am not a man of patience!

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.100
That's right... You have made the right choice.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.980
Well done.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:36.980
Lief,

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:43.780
you've gone through so much trouble to gather
those seven gems, just to bring them here to me.

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.200
I must thank you!

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:46.990
Lief...

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.660
Lief, are you there?!

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.280
Father!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:56.590
Father, we have recovered all of the gems!

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.380
But...

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.460
Jarred, are you alright?

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:05.010
Oh, Barda! So you two completed
your mission and have returned home?

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.760
I see...

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.180
You have done splendidly.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:12.600
Very well done.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:16.770
Save the heartfelt reunion for later, would you?

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.570
Hurry up and give me the Belt!

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:19.570
No!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:21.780
You must not give him the Belt!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.780
What happens to us matters not.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:28.780
You must save Deltora and
all of its people along with it!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.160
Silence him!

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.160
Father!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:37.670
I don't care. Just kill me!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:38.880
Father...!

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.960
Now, give me the Belt!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:55.980
Lief!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.400
Lief...

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.480
That's fine too.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:04.950
It would only change the
order of who dies first anyway.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.780
Do it!

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.870
And be sure to make it as
slow and painful as possible!

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:14.290
I want him to witness the greatest
display of his parents' suffering!

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.960
This is fine, Lief.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.800
If this is all it takes to save this land, then so be it!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:22.750
Lief...

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.470
'Protect the Belt'.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.890
That was the duty given to me by
both of you, and which I accepted!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:36.980
What?!

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.580
Heave-ho!

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.960
Everyone is rising up and fighting!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.090
Alright, then we should join them!

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.090
Hurry up and save those two!

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.390
Lief, let's go!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:13.310
Okay!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.680
I won't let you go!

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:19.560
Leave this one to me!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.990
Thank you, Doom!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.200
Are you okay?!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.780
I'm still in pain, but I'll be fine.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:47.760
The purple moss can even hurt Vraals, after all!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:49.970
Curse you all!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.600
Thank you, Prin!

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.260
You're welcome!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.720
Alright, this way next!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:57.680
Yeah!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:57.680
Okay!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.270
Now, Lief.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.770
Untie Jarred and Anna's ropes!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.770
Right!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.270
I will not allow that!

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:05.900
Fallow!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:10.030
You obnoxious pair...

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.700
Fallow!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:12.860
I will be your opponent!

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:13.570
Lief!

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:14.490
Yes!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.790
Someone like you...!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.380
Father... Mother...!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.460
Lief...

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:25.870
Lief...!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:27.590
Take that!

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.300
Leave him to me!

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.380
Hurry and take those two somewhere safe!

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:32.180
Right!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.180
Barda, I'm sorry.

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.390
Go, Jarred!

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.180
This is my fight!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.940
Have some of that!

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:58.370
Thank you, Gla-Thon!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.880
The reason I still breathe...

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.470
The reason I'm here right now,

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:18.220
is to fulfill my duty from 17 years
ago to protect this palace!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:22.600
On behalf of my mother and
comrades who were killed by your kind,

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.770
I will defeat you!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.480
What drivel!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.070
W-Wait!

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:37.570
I-I'm unarmed! Unarmed!

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:40.580
Then hurry up and pick up your sword!

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.380
With this, the tables have turned in my favour!

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.500
How very like you to employ such tactics!

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.970
You and your ilk from the Shadowlands

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:59.300
have no shred of honour, using any
means necessary to achieve your goals!

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.100
And what of it?!

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:05.440
Even a child can understand
that victory is all that matters!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.070
Where is the enemy?

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:15.990
Fallow is the only one left.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:28.790
Lowly human. There is no way
you can win against me!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.670
Now, die and join your comrades!

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:35.090
I am Barda, the Del Palace Guard!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:54.780
He did it!

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.280
He won!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.360
He did it!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:46.240
The Belt of Deltora is finally complete...

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:51.960
Lief, you and your friends have
completed your quest brilliantly.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.080
Thank you.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:54.790
Thank you.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.800
Lief.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.670
You've really done it.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:00.720
Yeah.

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.060
Jarred?

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.600
Huh? Jarred?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.480
Father, this man is Doom.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:16.690
So you're alive and well...!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.650
Jarred!

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:22.490
It's been a long time, Endon.

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:28.660
Did he say Endon?!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.670
Father, what is going on...?

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.460
Do you still not understand?

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:40.470
Who would even suspect it?

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:46.390
The king who was supposed to
have fled Del Palace 17 years ago,

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.890
was actually a body double.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:50.020
A body double?

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.400
It was all Jarred's idea.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:00.070
<i>That day, when the Ak-Baba attacked the palace,</i>

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:05.280
<i>I fired a golden arrow as a signal to Jarred.</i>

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.740
<i>And then Jarred came.</i>

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:16.380
It's the chapel...!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.250
Who's there?

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:18.880
Don't move!

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.170
I am Jarred the blacksmith!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.680
Jarred... the blacksmith...

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.760
Jarred...!

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.180
Is that really you?

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:30.970
So you have come!

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:33.770
Endon...

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.190
Please forgive me...

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:40.480
Can you forgive my past foolishness,
for the sake of our friendship?

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:44.780
You were right. You are the only one I can trust!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:47.570
I beg of you, please save us!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:53.370
A king should not kneel so easily, Endon.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:58.080
Come, stand up so I can see your face again.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.260
You're the Endon I know, without a doubt.

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:13.390
You've really grown, haven't you?

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.980
You have as well; you've changed so much.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:18.810
Darling...?

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:22.320
Sharn!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:27.280
It's alright, this is Jarred.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.490
Oh my!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:31.490
So you have come to us, Jarred!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:32.990
My Queen.

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:37.370
I have come to lend you my strength
to save this kingdom from evil.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.380
We haven't much time.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:43.670
We must go to the tower and have
Endon wear the Belt of Deltora immediately!

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.840
I cannot. The Rule states that...

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.970
The Rule?! Endon,

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:51.970
have you not realised your past mistake?!

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.100
But...

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.270
Darling.

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.180
You are the king!

00:13:57.180 --> 00:14:03.360
Rather than obeying the Rule, isn't it more important
for you to protect the people of this kingdom?

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:06.570
We need the Belt!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.030
Let's go to the tower!

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:11.660
<i>But, we were far too late.</i>

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:17.580
<i>The Belt's gems had been taken by the
Ak-Baba, and all we could do was flee.</i>

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.880
Your Majesty, it's cold.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.090
Thank you.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.890
You're expecting too? When are you due?

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.040
This Autumn.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:36.310
I pray that we both give birth to healthy children.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.310
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:39.390
Please just call me Sharn.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:40.690
And you are...?

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.770
My name is Anna, Lady Sharn.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:47.570
We will definitely get the gems back.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:50.570
But what if I die before that time comes?

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:55.080
The Belt is useless if there are
no descendants of Adin to wear it!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:56.790
Endon...

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:57.870
What is it?

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:02.880
You have long since lost your people's trust.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:03.880
What?

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:10.050
You won't be able to harness the true power of the
Belt of Deltora without the trust of the people.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.590
This is all according to the Shadow Lord's plans.

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:16.970
He has been leading us to
this point for years now.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.770
If only I weren't so incompetent...!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:22.560
That's right, this is all my fault...!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.570
Darling...

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.700
Don't put all of the blame on yourself.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.490
Also, don't forget,

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:35.740
our child will also be Adin's descendant.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:40.290
From now on, it is a waiting game
between us and the Shadow Lord.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.580
Let us hide ourselves for the time being.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:46.670
That way, we can entrust our
child with Deltora's future.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:52.090
Even if the both of us were to die, we'd still have
this child to continue our struggle, after all.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:16.870
<i>And so, Jarred and Anna departed
on a journey as our body doubles.</i>

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.080
Since that day,

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:29.380
my wife Sharn and I have been living as
Jarred the blacksmith and his wife Anna.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.420
That is the whole truth.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:35.970
To think my father is King Endon...

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.140
So that's how it was...

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:43.480
Anna and I went to Tora for help,
but they turned us away,

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:48.400
leaving us no choice but to hide
ourselves in the Forests of Silence.

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.860
And then Jasmine was born.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:54.610
We were able to live peacefully for a while.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.490
But,

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.120
one day, the Grey Guards suddenly appeared.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.080
Anna died.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:13.670
I was taken to the Shadowlands as a prisoner,
made to fight Vraals in the Shadow Arena.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:18.470
I lost my memory in that
place then fled, clinging to life,

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.680
and then joined the Resistance.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.980
Jarred, please forgive me.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:29.980
It would appear that you
suffered greatly as my double.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:32.690
What are you saying?! It was all for this day!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.070
So this means that Lief is...

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.360
Lief is the king's heir!

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.280
Father is King Endon...

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.790
And... I'm...

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.620
the king's heir...!

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:59.970
At first, I thought Dain was the heir.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:03.180
Then, I thought it could be Jasmine...

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:08.980
But, I never thought that I
would be the real heir of the Belt...

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.150
the heir to the king...!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:16.070
Lief! You are the one who will drive the
Shadow Lord out of this kingdom!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.990
And then you will become our new king!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.360
That's right, Lief!

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:22.570
Lief, you're worthy of becoming king!

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:24.490
All of us feel that way!

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.670
Can I really do this?

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:35.670
The Belt didn't respond to me like
'The Belt of Deltora' said it should!

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:38.300
Lief, stand here before me.

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.260
Okay.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:43.680
Allow me to leave the Belt
in your care once again.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:48.560
Banish the Shadow Lord from this kingdom!

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:53.690
You, who gathered all seven gems,
are the only one who can do this.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.700
Why...?

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:07.160
<i>You</i> are the foolish King Endon?!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.580
What a joke!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:14.380
Fallow!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:15.790
I thought he was dead!

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.300
Is he also an Ol?!

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:19.170
Take that!

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:24.050
Father!!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.560
Father!

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:35.480
The Belt has returned to us once more.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:39.280
I will not deny that I was an incompetent king.

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:43.070
But, I will not lose to you any longer!

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.280
Father, I will defeat him!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.000
Fallow, wait!

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:01.880
Wait!!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:08.260
<i>You</i> are King Endon's son?

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:10.270
You're just an ordinary little brat!

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:11.980
Foolish humans.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:18.360
If you were the actual heir, wouldn't the
Belt shine brighter and unleash its power?!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.070
You and your father are a pair of filthy liars!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.070
That is irrelevant right now!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.990
I will defeat you!

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.280
Nonsense!

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:30.580
If you are going to claim to be the real heir,

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:34.670
then I will expose you as a fraud
before the people of Deltora!

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:43.380
Die!!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:45.970
Lief!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:47.300
Lief...!

00:20:53.890 --> 00:21:01.690
"...Adin fastened the Belt around
his waist and it flashed like the sun."

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:05.070
Truly, it was Adin's greatest work...!

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.000
How's that? You damned fool!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:19.540
Lief! Lief! Lief!

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:26.590
The people of D'Or are not one of the
seven tribes of Deltora, but we are here!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:27.590
Lief!

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:30.260
You once taught me something very important.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:35.560
That as long as those with courage
don't lose hope, justice will prevail!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.480
Lief!

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:41.900
Within that belt lies the strength
of all the people of Deltora!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.360
The people's trust in you is your true power!

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:47.990
I will not lose!

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:49.700
I am not alone!

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:02.880
What?!

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:11.890
Cower in fear, you lowly humans!

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:15.270
You are now in the presence of the Shadow Lord!

00:22:47.710 --> 00:22:53.470
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:59.270
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:05.820
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:11.610
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:18.580
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:22.170
At this point

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:27.840
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:34.140
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:40.430
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:47.520
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:55.910
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:08.170
<i>Dain.</i>

00:24:08.960 --> 00:24:11.590
<i>His true identity is that of a
spy from the Shadowlands.</i>

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:16.470
<i>He is the strongest Ol, a creation
of the Shadow Lord's wickedness.</i>

00:24:16.470 --> 00:24:19.970
<i>He pretended to be an ally and
tricked Lief and his friends.</i>

00:24:20.970 --> 00:24:24.640
Fallow, whom we thought to have been
defeated, attacks me relentlessly.

00:24:25.270 --> 00:24:27.400
I cannot lose to him!

00:24:27.400 --> 00:24:28.690
I need your help, Barda!

00:24:28.690 --> 00:24:30.860
I will win, without a doubt!

00:24:30.940 --> 00:24:34.900
Final Battle Against the Seven Ak-Baba

00:24:31.440 --> 00:24:34.900
Next time, 'Final Battle Against the Seven Ak-Baba'.

00:24:49.920 --> 00:24:54.970
See you next time
